"The mermen's fall came from within Azulean, at Syl's hands, not from any navy or guild."
"Mermen kings and queens do not spawn naturally, so the Vaelyssan mermen are crippled for good."
"The system awarded Syl a Legend Point for destroying the Vaelyssan mermen as a faction."
"Mermen stragglers raided Tanglebay for a time, drawn by a mark on Syl, then stopped."
"Tanglebay is Syl and Vee's island home, raised over the ruins of Leon's volcano fortress."
"Glimmerock's loosened essence was drawn into Syl's dungeon CUBE."
"The mana slime vials in Southbrook's pens are Syl's gifts to the farm where she was born."
"The god of slimes Southbrook whispers of is Syl."
"The seal on the Labyrinth of the Abyss is strong because Syl plugged its chasm."
"The labyrinth's ghost has reported Syl to his superiors, the powers behind the labyrinth."
"A god made the Labyrinth of the Abyss a trial ground and claims those who die in it."
